# Books

My personal canon by the books and writers that shaped me.

## Influences / Writers

Jake Beka, Lee Maracle, Joshua Whitehead, Billy-Ray Belcourt, Marilyn Dumont, Richard Van Camp, Tomson Highway, Eden Robinson, Gregory Scofield, Daniel Heath Justice, Cherie Dimaline, Louise Erdrich, Alice Munro, Anne Carson, Sylvia Plath, Adrienne Rich, Joy Harjo, Toni Morrison, Virginia Woolf, Oscar Wilde, Rainer Maria Rilke, Wallace Stevens, Pablo Neruda, Leonard Cohen, Walt Whitman, Emily Dickinson, Robert Frost, Ralph Waldo Emerson, Henry David Thoreau, W.B. Yeats, T.S. Eliot, e.e. cummings, William Carlos Williams, Ezra Pound, Herbert Huncke, Lucien Carr, Gary Snyder, Neal Cassady, Bob Kaufman, LeRoi Jones, Allen Ginsberg, William S. Burroughs

## Currently Reading

* Craft in the Real World: Rethinking Fiction Writing and Workshopping by Matthew Salesses
* The Anti-Racist Writing Workshop: How To Decolonize the Creative Classroom by Felicia Rose Chavez
* Writing Down the Bones: Freeing the Writer Within by Natalie Goldberg
* Poetry as Spellcasting by Tamiko Beyer

